    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNumber 15 Grosvenor Square is a substantial two storey over basement property, currently laid out into five Pre- '63 apartments with supporting necessary declarations provided for seven flats (later converted to five). This attractive property comes to the market with full occupancy. 9 months notice required to tenants to gain vacant possession. \n\nInternally the accommodation extends to 222 sq. m. /2,390 sq. ft. approx. and consists of an entrance hallway with 5 self-contained apartments, all ranging in size. Four one-bedroom apartments and one two-bedroom apartment. There is a communal east facing garden to the rear with pedestrian access to Mount Drummond Avenue and residents on street permit parking on the square. \n\nThe property enjoys an almost unparalleled sense of convenience, conveniently situated on this popular residential road, easy access is afforded to all of the amenities that Rathmines Town Centre has to offer to include food stores, restaurants and cafes. The villages of Rathgar and Rathmines and St Stephen's Green are all within a gentle stroll.\n\nTo the front, the garden is bordered by railings with pedestrian access. \n\nTo the rear, the garden is laid out in concrete with a large lawned area and pedestrian access to Mount Drummond Avenue. \n\nViewing is recommended and can be arranged by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGarden Level - \n\n\nFlat 1 - 4.47m x 5.03m\n1 bedroom: studio with kitchenette, shower room fireplace, window to front and seperate utility.\n\nFlat 2 - 4.59m x 4.36m\n1 bedroom: double bedroom, seperate kitchen/dining room, shower room, fireplace and windows to rear.\n\nHall Level - \n\n\nFlat 3 - 4.70m x 4.60m\n1 bedroom: double bedroom with window to rear, high ceilings, large window to front, kitchen/dining/living room, fireplace and shower room.\n\nHall level return - \n\n\nFlat 4 - 3.71m x 2.83m\n1 bedroom: kitchen/dining room, window to side, spiral staircase to double bedroom, windwo to rear and shower room.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nFlat 5 - 4.79m x 3.78m\n2 double bedrooms, one: one to front and one to rear , seperate kitchen, living room, high ceilings, coving and shower room on second floor return.\n\n"
      },
